Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:28.70,特效,,0,0,0,,《复仇者联盟3：无限战争》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:53.45,特效,,0,0,0,,(史蒂夫·罗杰斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:42.18,特效,,0,0,0,,(安全门)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.28,0:27:20.11,特效,,0,0,0,,(史蒂夫·罗杰斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.18,0:27:29.08,特效,,0,0,0,,(太空)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.53,0:28:41.24,特效,,0,0,0,,(保卫者)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.30,0:36:42.06,特效,,0,0,0,,(苏格兰)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.81,0:37:38.52,特效,,0,0,0,,(最新消息：纽约遭受攻击)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.20,0:37:47.28,特效,,0,0,0,,(特别报导：托尼·斯塔克失踪)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.00,0:47:24.94,特效,,0,0,0,,(虚无知地)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.50,0:58:47.61,特效,,0,0,0,,(瓦坎达)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.20,1:14:45.71,特效,,0,0,0,,(尼达维)
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.99,1:18:47.97,特效,,0,0,0,,(泰坦星)
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.62,1:24:30.92,特效,,0,0,0,,(沃米尔星)
Dialogue: 0,2:29:15.55,2:29:19.34,特效,,0,0,0,,灭霸将会回归
Dialogue: 0,2:28:55.65,2:28:59.49,特效,,0,0,0,,(正在发送)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是阿斯加德难民船 要员号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the Asgardian refugee vessel Statesman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们遭遇了袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are under assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我重复 我们遭遇了袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, we are under assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,引擎熄火 生命保障系统濒临崩溃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The engines are dead, life support failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,请求附近飞船支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Requesting aid from any vessel within range.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我们距阿斯加德22个跳跃点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are 22 jump points out of Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.88,0:00:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,船上人员均是阿斯加德家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our crew is made up of Asgardian families.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.56,0:00:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的士兵很少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have very few soldiers here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这并非战舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a warcraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我重复 这并非战舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I repeat, this is not a warcraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 你们应当开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear me and rejoice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.57,0:01:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have had the privilege{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.85,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,被伟大泰坦所拯救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of being saved by the Great Titan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你们或许觉得这是折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may think this is suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这是拯救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is salvation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.18,0:01:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你们的牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Universal scales tip toward balance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙的天平得以平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because of your sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,笑笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.00,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For even in death,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.13,0:01:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也成为了灭霸的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have become Children of Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂得失败的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what it's like to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.40,0:02:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,明明深切地知道你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To feel so desperately that you're right...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.07,0:02:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,却还是失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet to fail, nonetheless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.87,0:02:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是很可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's frightening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,让人的腿发软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turns the legs to jelly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,但我问你 这又何必\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I ask you, to what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.63,0:02:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕 逃避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dread it, run from it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.19,0:02:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,命运总会到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}destiny arrives all the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.84,0:02:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 它来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, it's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,或者我该说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or should I say...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:02:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你话太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You talk too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.10,0:02:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.95,0:03:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,换你哥哥的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or your brother's head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.74,0:03:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该有所取舍吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume you have a preference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.37,0:03:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.21,0:03:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.41,0:03:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.14,0:03:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方不在我们这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have the Tesseract.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.21,0:03:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,它在阿斯加德上被毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was destroyed on Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.94,0:03:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是最差劲的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really are the worst brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.80,0:03:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证 哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you, brother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.71,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还会时来运转的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sun will shine on us again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的乐观用错了地方 阿斯加德人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your optimism is misplaced, Asgardian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我不是阿斯加德人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, for one thing, I'm not Asgardian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.44,0:04:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,另外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for another...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.67,0:04:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have a Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,让他玩吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him have his fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,众神之父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allfathers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让黑暗魔法最后一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let the dark magic flow through me one last...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,流过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我会要你偿命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to die for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,卑微的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My humble personage...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,向您的伟大臣服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bows before your grandeur.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.33,0:06:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,从没有过什么人 如此强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No other being has ever had the might...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如此崇高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nay, the nobility...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.13,0:06:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,能够操控不仅一枚 而是两枚无限宝石的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to wield not one, but two Infinity Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:44.63,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙已经唾手可得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The universe lies within your grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,地球上还有两颗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are two more stones on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,找到它们 我的孩子 带去泰坦星上给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find them, my children, and bring them to me on Titan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.91,0:07:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,父亲 我们不会辜负你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, we will not fail you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,容我插嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I might interject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们要去地球 你们或许需要向导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're going to Earth, you might want a guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这方面还有点经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do have a bit of experience in that arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你认为失败也算经验的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you consider failure experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为经验就是经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I consider experience experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,全能的灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almighty Thanos...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我 洛基 阿斯加德王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, Loki, prince of Asgard...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,奥丁森\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Odinson...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.96,0:08:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,约顿海姆的合法国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rightful king of Jotunheim...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,恶作剧之神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}god of mischief...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.17,0:08:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在此向你宣誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do hereby pledge to you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不死的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my undying fidelity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Undying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你措辞该更小心点的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should choose your words more carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.95,0:08:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,永远不会成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will never be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.80,0:09:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这次别想复活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No resurrections this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.99,0:09:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不 洛基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Loki.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 你没有钱吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, you don't have any money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.92,0:10:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对物质的依恋 就是与精神的断层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attachment to the material is detachment from the spiritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.25,0:10:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把这话告诉熟食店的人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell the guys at the deli.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他们能给你做个形而上黑面包火腿三明治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they'll make you a metaphysical ham on rye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.72,0:10:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我好像有两百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait, wait. I think I have 200.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,美元吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dollars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.88,0:10:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卢布 - 那是多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rupees. - Which is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,1.5美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buck and a half.{\r}
