Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.60,0:14:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 他拿到了力量和空间宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No telling. He has the Power and Space Stones.{\r}
