Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:14:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,有点牙碜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bit chalky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢大块绿巨人热巧克力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Hunk of Hulk of Burning Fudge is our favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.08,0:15:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有这玩意吗 - 不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a thing? - Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,重点是 情况会变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point is, things change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.66,0:15:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们保护时间宝石的誓言不能改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our oath to protect the Time Stone cannot change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.47,0:15:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这颗宝石可能是我们对抗灭霸的最佳机会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this stone may be the best chance we have against Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那么反过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so conversely,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也可能是他对抗我们的最佳机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it may also be his best chance against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不能尽职的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, if we don't do our jobs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.31,0:15:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你的职责究竟是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your job exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,除了捏气球动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides making balloon animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,保护你的现实 混球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protecting your reality, douchebag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位 我们能先别吵吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, guys. Could we table this discussion right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,事实就是 我们有这颗宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is we have this stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.44,0:15:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们知道它在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,幻视还带着心灵宝石不知道人在何处呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision is out there somewhere with the Mind Stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得马上找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have to find him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.22,0:15:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,问题就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.90,0:15:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,两周前 幻视关闭了他的应答机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two weeks ago, Vision turned off his transponder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.65,0:15:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他下线了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's offline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.39,0:15:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼 你又弄丢一个超级机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, you lost another super-bot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我没弄丢他 他没那么简单了 他在进化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't lose him. He's more than that. He's evolving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那谁能找到幻视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who could find Vision then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.58,0:15:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,史蒂夫·罗杰斯或许能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably Steve Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.59,0:15:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.13,0:15:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.49,0:16:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,打给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.27,0:16:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.66,0:16:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 我们真是好久没联络了 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, we haven't caught up in a spell, have we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.70,0:16:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.58,0:16:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,复仇者联盟解散了 我们完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Avengers broke up. We're toast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,解散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Broke up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.09,0:16:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,像乐队那样吗 像披头士那样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a band? Like... Like the Beatles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.19,0:16:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,队长和我闹得很僵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cap and I fell out hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在不说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not on speaking terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸要来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟不跟谁说话都无所谓了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter who you're talking to or not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,翻盖手机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flip phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,博士 你是在自己动头发吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say, Doc, you wouldn't happen to be moving your hair, would ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.91,0:17:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at the moment, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.04,0:17:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.75,0:17:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮帮他 - 班纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help him! - Banner!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.73,0:17:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 王 精神点 - 去吧 我们能行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wong! Look alive! - Go, go! We got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,星期五 什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friday, what am I looking at?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不确定 我还在查看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not sure. I'm working on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好把时间宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might wanna put that Time Stone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.35,0:17:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,塞后兜里 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in your back pocket, Doc!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.97,0:18:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还是用它更好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might wanna use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,内德 我需要你分散大家的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ned, hey. I need you to cause a distraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.16,0:18:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.65,0:18:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.32,0:18:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有架飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a spaceship!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.64,0:18:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事啊 - 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on? - Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.60,0:18:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这些孩子怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter with you kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.83,0:18:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没见过宇宙飞船啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never seen a spaceship before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.06,0:19:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,星期五 疏散43街以南的群众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friday, evac anyone south of 43rd Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,通知应急人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notify first responders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.94,0:19:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 你们应当开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hear me and rejoice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.63,0:19:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你们即将死在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are about to die{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.16,0:19:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸的孩子手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the hands of the Children of Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.23,0:19:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,心怀感激吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be thankful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.96,0:19:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们毫无意义的人生将贡献…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your meaningless lives are now contributing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 地球今天歇业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, Earth is closed today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.75,0:19:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你们最好收拾东西滚蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better pack it up and get outta here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,宝石守护者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stonekeeper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这喋喋不休的动物能替你说话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this chattering animal speak for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:19:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,当然不 我想说什么自己说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly not. I speak for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在这座城市和这颗星球都不受欢迎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're trespassing in this city and on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.78,0:20:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是滚蛋的意思 章鱼哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He means get lost, Squidward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他让我厌烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He exhausts me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.49,0:20:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,把宝石拿来给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,班纳 你想出手吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banner, you want a piece?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.05,0:20:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,并不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.16,0:20:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,但我什么时候如愿过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when do I ever get what I want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好 加把劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Push!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好久没见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.51,0:20:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,能再见到你会很高兴的 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be good to have you, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,容我…我得集中精神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me just... I need to concentrate here for a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.25,0:20:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我们最近有点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. We've sorta been having a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.13,0:20:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在不是有问题的时候 - 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's no time for a thing. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.31,0:20:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那才是问题 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the thing right there. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.14,0:20:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 你让我巫师面前下不来台了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you're embarrassing me in front of the wizards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.45,0:20:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼 抱歉 不是我不能 就是他不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, I'm sorry. Either I can't or he won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.61,0:20:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.31,0:20:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,退后吧 替我看着点他 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, stand down. Keep an eye on him. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.95,0:20:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 交给我吧 - 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have him. - Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那是哪来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd that come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.52,0:21:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是纳米科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nanotech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.37,0:21:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢吗 是我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like it? A little something I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,班纳博士 如果你的绿朋友不打算来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor Banner, if the rest of your green friend won't be joining us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,快把宝石送走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta get that stone outta here, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.94,0:21:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我人在宝石在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It stays with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.33,0:21:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,托尼 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tony, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.48,0:21:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 情况怎么样 是好是坏 - 可好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How we doing? Good? Bad? - Really, really good.{\r}
