Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想 他不肯出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying. He won't come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.80,0:22:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,锤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.77,0:22:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 绿巨人 你这是干什么啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Hulk! What are you doing to me?{\r}
