Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.85,0:22:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 斯塔克先生 你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man. What's up, Mr. Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.64,0:22:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 你哪冒出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid, where'd you come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.88,0:22:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当时正要去现代艺术博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A field trip to MoMA.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.40,0:22:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙什么毛病 斯塔克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this guy's problem, Mr. Stark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.63,0:22:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他是外太空来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, he's from space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.84,0:22:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他是来偷一个巫师的项链的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came here to steal a necklace from a wizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.65,0:23:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你的能力很有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your powers are quaint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.58,0:23:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定很受孩子的喜欢吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be popular with children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.27,0:23:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然是简单的咒语 但不可攻破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a simple spell but quite unbreakable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.20,0:23:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那我就先杀了你再拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I'll take it off your corpse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.21,0:23:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你会发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find{\r}
