Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.57,0:23:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,一个死人的咒语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a dead man's spell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.70,0:23:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,会很困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}troublesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.79,0:23:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你会生不如死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll only wish you were dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.07,0:23:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.80,0:23:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 就是那个巫师 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kid, that's the wizard. Get on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.13,0:23:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.41,0:24:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好过分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.32,0:24:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!{\r}
