Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.91,0:24:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生 我被光吸上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, Mr. Stark, I'm being beamed up.{\r}
