Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.60,0:24:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,给我点动力 星期五\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a little juice, Friday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.53,0:25:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,启动17A\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlock 17:A.{\r}
