Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.51,0:25:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克先生 这里面闻起来像新车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Stark, it smells like a new car in here!{\r}
