Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.92,0:25:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 星期五 送他回家 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Friday, send him home. - Yep.{\r}
