Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.78,0:26:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 派珀 - 赶紧给我回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pep. - Come back here right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.14,0:26:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,老板 信号要断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boss, we're losing her.{\r}
