Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.28,0:29:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.83,0:29:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,这 是个男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This... This is a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.57,0:29:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,一个帅气的肌肉男\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A handsome, muscular man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.44,0:29:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我也挺肌肉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm muscular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.25,0:29:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗谁呢 奎尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who are you kidding, Quill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.39,0:29:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你再吃一个三明治就是一身肥膘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one sandwich away from fat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.20,0:29:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,得了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.02,0:29:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 奎尔 你是胖了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true, Quill. You have put on weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.97,0:29:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.98,0:29:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉 你也觉得我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamora, do you think I'm...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.27,0:30:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他很焦虑 生气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is anxious, angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.80,0:30:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他失去了很多 非常愧疚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He feels tremendous loss and guilt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.74,0:30:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,简直就像一个海盗跟一个天使生了个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a pirate had a baby with an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.75,0:30:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这对我真是一记警钟啊 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a real wake-up call for me. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.64,0:30:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我去买个博飞健身器 认真减肥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get a Bowflex. I'm gonna commit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.48,0:30:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,再去弄个哑铃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get some dumbbells.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.76,0:30:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道哑铃是不能吃的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you can't eat dumbbells, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.23,0:30:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他的肌肉就像是柯塔蒂金属纤维做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like his muscles are made of Cotati metal fibers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.63,0:30:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,别给他的肌肉按摩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop massaging his muscles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.47,0:30:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,弄醒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.22,0:30:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.70,0:30:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.83,0:30:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,自从我认识灭霸 他就只有一个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The entire time I knew Thanos, he only ever had one goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.58,0:30:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,让宇宙获得平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To bring balance to the universe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.24,0:31:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,方法是抹去一半生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by wiping out half of all life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.94,0:31:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他以前会一个个星球地杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He used to kill people planet by planet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.57,0:31:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,一次次地进行屠杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}massacre by massacre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.44,0:31:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,包括我的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.72,0:31:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他拿到全部六颗无限宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he gets all six Infinity Stones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.64,0:31:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那他打一个响指就能实现愿望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he can do it with the snap of his fingers like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.85,0:31:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你似乎对灭霸很了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to know a great deal about Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.77,0:31:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉是灭霸的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamora is the daughter of Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.48,0:31:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲杀了我弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father killed my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.97,0:31:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.32,0:31:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,严格讲是继父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stepfather, technically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.23,0:31:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟你一样恨他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she hates him as much as you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,家家有本难念的经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Families can be tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.38,0:31:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲死前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before my father died,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.76,0:31:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,才跟我说我还有个异母姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he told me that I had a half-sister...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.88,0:31:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,被他囚禁在了地狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he imprisoned in Hel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.12,0:31:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,然后她回了家 捅瞎了我的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then she returned home and stabbed me in the eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.35,0:31:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,于是我不得不杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I had to kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.91,0:31:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,人生啊 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's life though, isn't it, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.02,0:31:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,兜兜转转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goes round and round and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.15,0:31:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我能理解你的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel your pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.06,0:31:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也能理解你的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel your pain as well, because...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.69,0:31:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然这不是比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's not a competition,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.78,0:31:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,但我也吃过不少苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've been through a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.43,0:31:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲杀了我妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father killed my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.03,0:31:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我不得不杀了我爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I had to kill my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.98,0:32:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那可痛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可能比杀姐姐还痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably even harder than having to kill a sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.24,0:32:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我还两眼完好无损地回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus, I came out with both my eyes, which was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.54,0:32:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要一把锤子 不是勺子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a hammer, not a spoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.95,0:32:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意怎么开 有什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I open this thing? Is there some sort of, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.18,0:32:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,四位密码 是生日吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A four-digit code, maybe? Maybe a birthdate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.17,0:32:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你干什么呢 - 开走你们的飞行舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing? - Taking your pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.01,0:32:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.09,0:32:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天别想开走我们的飞行舱 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not be taking our pod today, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.89,0:32:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,奎尔 你是在故意把嗓音压低吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quill, are you making your voice deeper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.90,0:32:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 就有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.57,0:32:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在模仿那个男神 好奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're imitating the god-man. It's weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.58,0:32:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.65,0:32:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他又来了 - 我的嗓音就是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He just did it again! - This is my voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.14,0:32:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你在嘲笑我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you mocking me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.64,0:32:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在嘲笑我吗 - 别闹了 你又那样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you mocking me? - Stop it. You did it again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.18,0:32:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他想模仿我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to copy me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.57,0:32:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to stop doing that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.37,0:32:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 够了 - 他先开始的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enough! - He's doing it first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.98,0:32:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得阻止灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to stop Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.67,0:33:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我们得查明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means we need to find out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.34,0:33:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他接下来要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he's going next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.29,0:33:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,虚无知地(不去哪)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.77,0:33:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他肯定会去什么地方的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must be going somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.60,0:33:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 虚无知地吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. Knowhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.75,0:33:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那是个地方 我们去过 烂爆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a place. We've been there. It sucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.59,0:33:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 那是我们的食物 - 现在不是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me, that's our food. - Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.51,0:33:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔 他为什么要去虚无知地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor, why would he go to Knowhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.81,0:33:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,因为多年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because for years...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.06,0:33:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现实宝石一直安全地放在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Reality Stone's been safely stored there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.32,0:33:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,在一个叫收藏者的人手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a man called the Collector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.99,0:33:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是在收藏者手上 那就不安全了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's with the Collector, then it's not safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.99,0:33:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只有白痴才会把宝石交给那人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only an idiot would give that man a stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.59,0:33:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 或是天才 - 你怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Or a genius. - How do you know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.11,0:33:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会去找其他的哪颗宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's not going for one of the other stones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.74,0:33:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,一共有六颗宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are six stones out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.41,0:33:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸已经拿到了力量宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos already has the Power Stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.95,0:33:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他上周摧毁山达尔星时偷走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he stole it last week when he decimated Xandar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.54,0:33:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他从我这儿偷走了空间宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He stole the Space Stone from me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.63,0:33:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,还摧毁了我的飞船 杀了我一半人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he destroyed my ship and slaughtered half my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.69,0:33:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,时间和心灵宝石在地球上很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Time and Mind Stones are safe on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.73,0:33:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,在复仇者联盟手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're with the Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.75,0:33:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 复仇者联盟 - 地球最强大的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The Avengers? - Earth's mightiest heroes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.05,0:33:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,就像凯文·贝肯吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like Kevin Bacon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.22,0:33:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,或许有他吧 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He may be on the team. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.82,0:33:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我挺久没回去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't been there in a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.94,0:33:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,至于灵魂宝石 根本没人见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As for the Soul Stone, well, no one's ever seen that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.40,0:33:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,都没人知道它在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one even knows where it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.98,0:33:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,因此灭霸得不到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore Thanos can't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.74,0:34:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,因此他会去虚无知地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Therefore he's going to Knowhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.48,0:34:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好拿到现实宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hence he'll be getting the Reality Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.08,0:34:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.94,0:34:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们得马上去虚无知地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we have to go to Knowhere now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.67,0:34:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们得去尼德威阿尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong. Where we have to go is Nidavellir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.83,0:34:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那个词是编出来的 - 所有词都是编出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's a made-up word. - All words are made up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.75,0:34:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,尼德威阿尔是真的 你认真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nidavellir is real? Seriously?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.96,0:34:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那地方是个传奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That place is a legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.30,0:34:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能造出最强大 最可怕的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They make the most powerful, horrific weapons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.46,0:34:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,来折腾整个宇宙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to ever torment the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.17,0:34:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是非常愿意去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would very much like to go there, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.46,0:34:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这只兔子说的对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rabbit is correct{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.47,0:34:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,它显然是你们当中最聪明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and clearly the smartest among you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.18,0:34:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 兔子 - 只有矮人伊特里能造出我需要的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rabbit? - Only Eitri the Dwarf can make me the weapon I need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.71,0:34:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是船长吧 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume you're the captain, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.01,0:34:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有眼光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very perceptive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.04,0:34:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起来像个高贵的领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem like a noble leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.43,0:34:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿意跟我一起去尼德威阿尔吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you join me on my quest to Nidavellir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.14,0:34:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让我问下船长 等一下 我就是船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me just ask the captain. Oh, wait a second, it's me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.19,0:34:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 我加入 - 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. I'll go. - Wonderful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.13,0:34:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我才是船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for that I'm the captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.23,0:34:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是我的背包 - 坐下吧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's my backpack. - Go sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.12,0:34:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, this is my ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.87,0:34:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会去什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not going to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.64,0:34:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 那是什么样的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what kinda weapon are we talking about here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.00,0:34:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,能杀灭霸的那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Thanos-killing kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.99,0:34:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不觉得我们每个人都应该弄把那样的武器吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you think that we should all have a weapon like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.76,0:34:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你们没有驾驭它们的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You simply lack the strength to wield them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.92,0:34:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的身体会碎裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your bodies would crumble{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.89,0:34:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,思维会崩溃 甚至疯掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as your minds collapsed into madness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:35:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在更想要了 会不会很奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it weird that I wanna do it even more now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.31,0:35:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 是有一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm, a little bit, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.26,0:35:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们不去虚无知地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we don't go to Knowhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.06,0:35:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而灭霸又得到一颗宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Thanos retrieves another stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.84,0:35:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他就会强大得不可阻挡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'll be too powerful to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.39,0:35:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他已经不可阻挡了 - 我有办法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He already is. - I got it figured out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有两艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got two ships{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.58,0:35:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,和一群各种各样的白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a large assortment of morons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.56,0:35:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我和格鲁特跟这位海盗天使走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So me and Groot will go with the pirate angel here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.18,0:35:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,白痴们去虚无知地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the morons will go to Knowhere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.85,0:35:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,试图阻止灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to try to stop Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.73,0:35:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好吗 好 - 很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cool? Cool. - So cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.92,0:35:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the record...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.84,0:35:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你跟他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know that you're going with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.14,0:35:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为灭霸不在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it's where Thanos isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.52,0:35:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的不应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you really shouldn't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.00,0:35:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这样跟你的船长讲话 奎尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}talk that way to your captain, Quill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.41,0:35:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,走了 格鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Groot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.18,0:35:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,把游戏放下 你的脑子会烂掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that game down. You'll rot your brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.62,0:35:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,再会了 祝你们好运 白痴们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bid you farewell and good luck, morons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.54,0:35:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.41,0:35:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,小幻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.06,0:36:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,又是宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it the stone again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.15,0:36:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,它好像在跟我说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's as if it's speaking to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.34,0:36:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,它说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does it say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.98,0:36:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我…不知道 但它说了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't... I don't know, but something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我你感觉到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what you feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.14,0:36:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我只感觉到了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just feel you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.06,0:36:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,10点有一班去格拉斯哥的列车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So there's a 10:00 A.M. to Glasgow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.91,0:36:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你回去之前 我们还能一起多待会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which would give us more time together before you went back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.18,0:36:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我错过那班车呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I miss that train?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.90,0:36:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,11点还有一班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an 11:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.02,0:36:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我错过所有车次呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I missed all the trains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.88,0:36:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这次我不回去了怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if this time I didn't go back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.80,0:36:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但你向斯塔克承诺过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gave Stark your word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.21,0:36:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我更想向你许下承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather give it to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.61,0:36:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也有人在等我回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there are people who are expecting me too, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.71,0:37:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都做过承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both made promises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.15,0:37:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有对彼此承诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.62,0:37:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,旺达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.14,0:37:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,两年了 我们偷来了这些相处的时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For two years, we've stolen these moments...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.84,0:37:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,想看看我们是不是合得来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to see if this could work and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.83,0:37:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.65,0:37:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想说说自己的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what, I'm just gonna speak for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.63,0:37:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.95,0:37:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们合得来 - 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It works. - It works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.97,0:37:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.63,0:37:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.80,0:37:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,留下陪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.40,0:37:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,或者算了 如果我出格了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or not. If I'm overstepping...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.59,0:37:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.74,0:37:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,正是宝石警告我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the stone was warning me about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.02,0:37:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.59,0:37:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不 幻视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.09,0:37:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,幻视 如果那是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision, if that's true,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.26,0:38:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那也许回去不是最好的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then maybe going isn't the best idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.26,0:38:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,旺达 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanda, I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.83,0:38:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,幻视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.62,0:38:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那刀刃 让我无法瞬移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blade, it stopped me from phasing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.43,0:38:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那可能吗 - 不该这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is that even possible? - It isn't supposed to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.39,0:38:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我的系统正在崩溃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My systems are failing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.98,0:38:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我开始觉得我们不该下床了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm beginning to think we should have stayed in bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.13,0:38:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,小幻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.36,0:39:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,放弃宝石 她才能活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give up the stone, and she lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.69,0:39:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,放开他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.66,0:39:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.19,0:39:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,快 你得站起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, you gotta get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.13,0:40:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你得站起来 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta get up. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.10,0:40:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.92,0:40:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Please leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.42,0:40:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我留下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked me to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.53,0:40:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要留下 - 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm staying. - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.96,0:41:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 起来 - 我起不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get up. - I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.86,0:41:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不想杀你 但我们不会手软的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't wanna kill you, but we will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.75,0:41:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,过时不候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll never get the chance again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.82,0:41:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你能站起来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you stand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.24,0:41:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.39,0:41:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,先扶你上飞机吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get you on the jet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.88,0:42:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是说好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I thought we had a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.53,0:42:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,别走太远 保持联系 不要冒险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay close, check in, don't take any chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.43,0:42:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.85,0:42:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是需要时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just wanted time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.37,0:42:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪里 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where to, Cap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.53,0:42:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.23,0:42:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会安全的 会安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be safe. We'll be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.28,0:42:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,泽霍贝瑞人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zehobereians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.42,0:42:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲 我母亲呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother! Where's my mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.93,0:42:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不选一边就要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Choose a side or die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.85,0:42:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.52,0:43:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,一边是启示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One side is a revelation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.84,0:43:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,另一边是只有少数人拥有的荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the other an honor known only to a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.65,0:43:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了 小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, little one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.90,0:43:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我母亲 我母亲在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother. Where is my mother?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.98,0:43:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.54,0:43:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫卡魔拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.80,0:43:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你很有斗志 卡魔拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're quite the fighter, Gamora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.44,0:43:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.92,0:43:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我来帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.35,0:43:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.10,0:43:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,很漂亮是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.56,0:43:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,平衡感恰到好处 正是一切事物应有的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfectly balanced, as all things should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,左右偏移太多的话…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too much to one side or the other...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.81,0:44:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,给 你试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. You try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.59,0:44:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,安详地去见你们的造物主吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, go in peace to meet your maker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.84,0:44:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,集中注意力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Concentrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.37,0:44:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了 你掌握了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. You've got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.65,0:44:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.82,0:44:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你知不知道这些手榴弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know if these grenades{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.84,0:44:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是炸掉蛋蛋的 还是毒气弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are the blow-off-your-junk kind or the gas kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.45,0:44:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想在皮带上挂几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I was thinking about hanging a couple on my belt right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.29,0:44:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可不想被炸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't want to if they're the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.22,0:44:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to ask a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.54,0:44:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.36,0:44:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One way or another,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.39,0:44:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都会与灭霸交手的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the path that we're on leads to Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.48,0:44:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是手榴弹的用处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is what the grenades are for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.68,0:44:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 你要我帮什么忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. What's the favor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.55,0:44:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果事情出了岔子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If things go wrong...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.31,0:45:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,如果灭霸抓到了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Thanos gets me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.98,0:45:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你答应我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to promise me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.94,0:45:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你会杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.91,0:45:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.99,0:45:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道一些他不知道的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know something he doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.91,0:45:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he finds it out,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.21,0:45:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那整个宇宙都有危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the entire universe could be at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.35,0:45:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.47,0:45:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我告诉你 你也知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I tell you, you'd know too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.59,0:45:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这事如此重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's so important...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.59,0:45:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我不该知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shouldn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.72,0:45:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你想死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only if you wanna die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.88,0:45:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么总有人要死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does somebody always have to die in this scenario?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.18,0:45:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.47,0:45:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 可能还要杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me. And possibly kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.60,0:45:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'd like to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.02,0:45:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真的 但是你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really would. But you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.06,0:45:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,向我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swear to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.83,0:45:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,以你母亲的名义向我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Swear to me on your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.51,0:46:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.30,0:46:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.02,0:46:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.94,0:46:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你在那里站了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long have you been standing there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.73,0:46:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.90,0:46:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,一小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.74,0:46:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.16,0:46:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经掌握了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've mastered the ability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.29,0:46:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,纹丝不动站立的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of standing so incredibly still...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.45,0:46:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,肉眼是看不到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I become invisible to the eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.58,0:46:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.96,0:46:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你在吃花生糖呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're eating a zarg-nut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.59,0:46:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我的动作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my movement...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.76,0:46:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如此缓慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was so slow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.16,0:46:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,令人难以察觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it's imperceptible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.77,0:47:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.68,0:47:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我坚信没人能看到我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure I'm invisible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.83,0:47:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,德拉克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Drax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.69,0:47:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.48,0:47:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方似乎已经荒废了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place looks deserted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.58,0:47:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,第三象限有动静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm reading movement in the third quadrant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.17,0:47:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我也看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep, I'm picking that up too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.78,0:47:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里降落吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's put down right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.89,0:47:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,东西不在我这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.70,0:47:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,银河系的人都知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone in the galaxy knows{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.23,0:47:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你愿出卖亲兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd sell your own brother...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.08,0:47:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,来为你可悲的收藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you thought it would add even the slightest trinket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.69,0:47:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,增添一点小装饰品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to your pathetic collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.49,0:48:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道现实宝石在你手上 蒂万\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you have the Reality Stone, Tivan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.75,0:48:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,把宝石交给我 你就不必遭受折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giving it to me will spare you a great deal of suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.61,0:48:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.05,0:48:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我卖掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.92,0:48:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我为什么要骗你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I lie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.93,0:48:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想骗人是你的天性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I imagine it's like breathing for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.39,0:48:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.99,0:48:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看来你明白啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.38,0:48:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是你也不会交出如此宝贵的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even you would surrender something so precious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.27,0:48:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时并不知道它是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know what it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.38,0:48:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那你比我想的还蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you're more of a fool than I took you for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.43,0:48:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.02,0:48:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,最后的机会 你这骗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last chance, charlatan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.41,0:48:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,宝石呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.60,0:48:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.07,0:48:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,德拉克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drax. Drax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.92,0:48:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他要为我妻女的死付出代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he pays for the deaths of my wife and daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.33,0:48:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,德拉克斯 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drax, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.72,0:48:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,别急 别急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet, not yet, not yet.{\r}
