Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.34,0:49:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,德拉克斯 听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drax, Drax, Drax. Listen to me.{\r}
