Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.22,0:49:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们拿到宝石 就能阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we get it, then we can stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.66,0:49:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得先拿到宝石 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get the stone first. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.08,0:49:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.28,0:49:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 为了奥薇特 为了卡玛莉亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. For Ovette, for Camaria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.85,0:49:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.29,0:49:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.17,0:49:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉 螳螂 你们去右边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamora, Mantis, you go right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.77,0:49:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,另一个右边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.17,0:50:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.86,0:50:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是你 女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you, daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.64,0:50:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好快啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.37,0:50:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,了不起 了不起 了不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnificent! Magnificent! Magnificent!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.63,0:50:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你难过了吗 女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that sadness I sense in you, daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.47,0:50:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我心里知道 你依然在乎我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my heart, I knew you still cared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.42,0:51:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但毕竟没法确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But one never knows for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.83,0:51:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,现实往往令人失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reality is often disappointing.{\r}
