Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.06,0:51:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.58,0:51:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现实可以任我摆布了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reality can be whatever I want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.80,0:51:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你早知道我会来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew I'd come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.41,0:51:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我就指望着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I counted on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.83,0:51:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要谈谈 小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something we need to discuss, little one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.37,0:51:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.85,0:51:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.24,0:52:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,放了她 奶昔大哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go, Grimace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.50,0:52:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.73,0:52:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你走右边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to go right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.47,0:52:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还说这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now? Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.06,0:52:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你放了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.80,0:52:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你是那个男友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, the boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.86,0:52:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.88,0:52:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢自视为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like to think of myself more as a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.33,0:52:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杀泰坦的长期炮友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Titan-killing, long-term booty call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.00,0:52:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放了她 - 彼得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let her go. - Peter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.06,0:52:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我轰掉你阴囊一样的下巴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna blow that nutsack of a chin right off your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.29,0:52:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.30,0:52:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过我 你答应了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised. You promised.{\r}
