Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.82,0:52:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他提的要求他做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expect too much from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.07,0:52:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟你提过了 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's asked, hasn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.48,0:53:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.81,0:53:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.09,0:53:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你走右边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you to go right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.44,0:53:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你超过一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you more than anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.62,0:53:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.33,0:53:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.21,0:54:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,幻视还没消息吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still no word from Vision?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.08,0:54:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,卫星在爱丁堡附近跟丢了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellites lost him somewhere over Edinburgh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.73,0:54:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,驾驶盗走的昆式战斗机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On a stolen Quinjet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.41,0:54:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还有四个全球头号通缉犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with four of the world's most wanted criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.68,0:54:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他们是"罪犯"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know they're only criminals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.02,0:54:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,只是因为你非要那么称呼他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you've chosen to call them that, right, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.96,0:54:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, Rhodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.07,0:54:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你鬼扯的本事能跟我有一拼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your talent for horseshit rivals my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.50,0:54:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是因为《协议》\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it weren't for those Accords,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.82,0:54:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,幻视根本不会走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision would've been right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.06,0:54:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得你也签了那份文件 中校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember your signature on those papers, Colonel.{\r}
