Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.81,0:54:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你后悔了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have second thoughts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.31,0:54:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,现在没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.72,0:54:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,国务卿先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Secretary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.90,0:54:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你好大胆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got some nerve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.07,0:55:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这我承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.97,0:55:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在正需要点胆呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could use some of that right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.64,0:55:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,世界有危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world's on fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.58,0:55:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得一切都被原谅了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you think all is forgiven?{\r}
