Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.15,0:55:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我更不想征求同意了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm way past asking permission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.40,0:55:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,地球刚失去了最好的守卫者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Earth just lost her best defender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.91,0:55:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是来战斗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we're here to fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.67,0:55:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想挡路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you wanna stand in our way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.60,0:55:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们连你一起打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll fight you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.11,0:55:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,逮捕他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrest them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.93,0:55:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.58,0:55:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,得上军事法庭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a court-martial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.54,0:55:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,见到你真高兴 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's great to see you, Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.55,0:55:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是 罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too, Rhodey.{\r}
