Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.05,0:55:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这几年很辛苦吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must've been a rough couple years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.72,0:55:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 没怎么住五星酒店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, the hotels weren't exactly five star.{\r}
