Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.86,0:56:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awkward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.75,0:56:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那他们还会再回来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we gotta assume they're coming back, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.65,0:56:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们显然能找到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they can clearly find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.93,0:56:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得全体出动 克林特呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need all hands on deck. Where's Clint?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.36,0:56:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,自从《协议》的事后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the whole Accords situation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.74,0:56:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他和斯科特做了协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he and Scott took a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.42,0:56:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的家人承受不了 所以他们被软禁在家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was too tough on their families. They're on house arrest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.30,0:56:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯科特是谁 - 蚁人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's Scott? - Ant-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.62,0:56:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有蚁人还有蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an Ant-Man and a Spider-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.13,0:56:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.18,0:56:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸有全宇宙最大的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos has the biggest army in the universe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.26,0:56:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会罢休的 除非他得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he is not gonna stop until he gets...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.78,0:56:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,幻视的宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision's stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.73,0:56:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们得保护它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we have to protect it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.15,0:56:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们得毁掉它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we have to destroy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.96,0:56:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我好好想过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been giving a good deal of thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.40,0:56:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我脑袋上的这东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to this entity in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.66,0:57:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,关于它的性质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About its nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.57,0:57:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,以及它的组成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But also its composition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.90,0:57:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得如果它遭遇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think if it were exposed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.86,0:57:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,足够强大的能量源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a sufficiently powerful energy source...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.22,0:57:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,特性类似其本身的能量 那或许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something very similar to its own signature, perhaps...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.32,0:57:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,它的分子完整性就会被破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}its molecular integrity could fail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.21,0:57:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会随之被摧毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and you with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.88,0:57:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是个选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not having this conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.46,0:57:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只有销毁宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eliminating the stone is the only way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.45,0:57:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,才能确保灭霸拿不到它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be certain that Thanos can't get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.15,0:57:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,那代价太高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's too high a price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.84,0:57:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,只有你有能力付出这代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only you have the power to pay it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.48,0:57:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸威胁宇宙一半的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos threatens half the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.64,0:57:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让一人的生命阻碍战胜他的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One life cannot stand in the way of defeating him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.36,0:57:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这样不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.26,0:57:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不以命换命 幻视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't trade lives, Vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.34,0:57:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,队长 70年前 你付出生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, 70 years ago, you laid down your life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.08,0:57:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,来挽救了多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to save how many millions of people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.72,0:57:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 这有什么不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, why is this any different?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.07,0:57:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为 你可能还有选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you might have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.68,0:57:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你的心灵是由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mind is made up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.00,0:58:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,许多东西叠加而成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a complex construct of overlays.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.70,0:58:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,贾维斯 奥创 托尼 我 宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jarvis, Ultron, Tony, me, the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.40,0:58:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他们混在了一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of them mixed together,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.24,0:58:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,彼此学习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all of them learning from one another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.12,0:58:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说幻视并不只是那块宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying Vision isn't just the stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.06,0:58:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 如果我们取出宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying that if we take out the stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.27,0:58:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还剩下不少的幻视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's still a whole lot of Vision left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.93,0:58:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,或许还是最好的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps the best parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.62,0:58:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这能做到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.61,0:58:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我在这里是不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not me, not here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.70,0:58:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那你最好赶紧找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you better find someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.24,0:58:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,合适的地方和人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and somewhere fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.73,0:58:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,罗斯可不会让你们再回老房间住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ross isn't just gonna let you guys have your old rooms back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.32,0:58:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.61,0:58:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,御林护卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Kingsguard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.56,0:58:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,和女子皇家护卫队都已得到通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Dora Milaje have been alerted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.61,0:58:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,边境部落呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Border Tribe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.31,0:58:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,还剩的都通知了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those that are left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.25,0:58:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,派人传话去贾巴里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send word to the Jabari as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.56,0:58:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,姆巴库也喜欢好好打一场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}M'Baku likes a good fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.86,0:59:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what of this one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.15,0:59:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他可能已经厌倦了战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one may be tired of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.73,0:59:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但白狼已经休息够久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the White Wolf has rested long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.40,0:59:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里要打仗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.91,0:59:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On its way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.80,0:59:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我为灭霸效力这么久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In all the time I've served Thanos...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.23,0:59:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,从未让他失望过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never failed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.25,1:00:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我赶到了我们泰坦星的汇合点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I were to reach our rendezvous on Titan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.46,1:00:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,而时间宝石还连在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Time Stone still attached{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.04,1:00:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你这讨厌鬼身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to your vaguely irritating person...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.38,1:00:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我会受到 责罚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there would be judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.73,1:00:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.38,1:00:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.14,1:00:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真是件忠心耿耿的外套啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a seriously loyal piece of outerwear, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.28,1:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,说到忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, uh, speaking of loyalty...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.08,1:00:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.04,1:00:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我知道你要说什么 - 你不该在这儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I know what you're gonna say. - You should not be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.74,1:00:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我本想回家的 - 我不想听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was gonna go home. - I don't wanna hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.04,1:00:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但下去的路好远啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was such a long way down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.95,1:00:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我路上就在想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I just thought about you on the way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.86,1:00:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你还说上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I gotta hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.56,1:00:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我就卡在飞船边上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and kinda stuck to the side of the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.67,1:00:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这件战衣的直觉特别准\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this suit is ridiculously intuitive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.31,1:00:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- by the way. - God damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.89,1:01:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,所以如果要说 我在这儿其实怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if anything, it's kinda your fault that I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.04,1:01:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 我收回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What did you just say? - I take that back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.61,1:01:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我在外太空里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, I'm here in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.12,1:01:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 在我不想要你在的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right where I didn't want you to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.97,1:01:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不是科尼岛 不是学校出游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't Coney Island. This isn't a field trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.94,1:01:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是有去无回\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a one-way ticket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.28,1:01:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,听到了吗 别假装你都想清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hear me? Don't pretend you thought this through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.20,1:01:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我想清楚了 - 你根本不可能想清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, I did think this through. - You could not have possibly thought this through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.65,1:01:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我想当个友好邻居蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't be a friendly neighborhood Spider-Man...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.39,1:01:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但没有邻居了还怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if there's no neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.27,1:01:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这话不是很通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that didn't really make sense,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.23,1:01:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但你明白我想说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you know what I'm trying to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.63,1:01:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 还有情况要处理呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. We got a situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.72,1:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看到下面那个了吗 他有麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See him down there? He's in trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.75,1:01:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.92,1:01:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.73,1:01:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.44,1:01:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你看过一部特老的电影《异形》吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Did you ever see this really old movie, Aliens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.35,1:01:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,疼吧 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Painful, aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.22,1:01:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,原本是用来做显微手术的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were originally designed for microsurgery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.90,1:01:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,任何一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And any one of them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.02,1:01:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都能瞬间杀死你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could end your friend's life in an instant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.62,1:02:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我得告诉你 他算不上是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta tell you, he's not really my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.58,1:02:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,救他命更多是职业上的礼貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saving his life is more of a professional courtesy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.12,1:02:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么都没救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've saved nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.76,1:02:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你的力量跟我比微不足道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your powers are inconsequential compared to mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.58,1:02:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但那孩子看的电影多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but the kid's seen more movies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.84,1:02:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,棒啊 等等 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes! Wait. What are those?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.06,1:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还没正式介绍过呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we haven't officially met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.07,1:02:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.19,1:02:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得调头回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta turn this ship around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.65,1:02:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 他现在想跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, now he wants to run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.64,1:02:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好计划 - 我想保护宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Great plan. - No, I want to protect the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.59,1:02:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我还想要你谢我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I want you to thank me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.66,1:02:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 我听着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, go ahead. I'm listening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.34,1:03:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢什么 差点把我轰进太空里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what? Nearly blasting me into space?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.35,1:03:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,刚是谁救了你个魔法师 是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who just saved your magical ass? Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.63,1:03:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,真不知道你这么膨胀的脑袋怎么塞得进头盔里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seriously don't know how you fit your head into that helmet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.27,1:03:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,承认吧 你早该听我的躲起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admit it, you should've ducked out when I told you to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.65,1:03:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你别插手的 你不肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to bench you. You refused.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.29,1:03:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不像你人生中的其他所有人 我不为你工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike everyone else in your life, I don't work for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.44,1:03:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And due to that fact,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.88,1:03:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在在一艘飞行甜甜圈上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're now in a flying doughnut...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.49,1:03:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,离地球十万八千里 还没有后援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}billions of miles from Earth with no backup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.37,1:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是后援 - 不 你是偷渡的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm backup. - No, you're a stowaway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.46,1:03:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大人说话呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The adults are talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.51,1:03:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我搞不懂你们什么关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I'm confused as to the relationship here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.46,1:03:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他是你的养子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is he, your ward?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.11,1:03:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.57,1:03:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是彼得 - 斯特兰奇博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm Peter, by the way. - Doctor Strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.61,1:03:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你在用诨号吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're using our made-up names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.27,1:03:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那我是蜘蛛侠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Spider-Man, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.43,1:03:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这艘船在自我纠正航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ship is self-correcting its course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.28,1:03:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,它在自动驾驶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thing's on autopilot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.36,1:03:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能控制它吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we control it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.14,1:03:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,飞回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly us home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.13,1:03:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 斯塔克 - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stark? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.09,1:03:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你能带我们回家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you get us home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.64,1:03:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I heard you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.30,1:03:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想 或许我们不该回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking I'm not so sure we should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.36,1:03:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们决不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under no circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.75,1:03:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,把时间宝石送去灭霸那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can we bring the Time Stone to Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.66,1:03:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你恐怕还不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you quite understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.99,1:03:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 事情的严重性吧 - 什么 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- what's at stake here. - What? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.20,1:04:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是你不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's you who doesn't understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.50,1:04:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸萦绕我的脑海六年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Thanos has been inside my head for six years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.42,1:04:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,自从他派了支军队去纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since he sent an army to New York{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.92,1:04:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在他又回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now he's back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.84,1:04:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I don't know what to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.82,1:04:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我不能确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm not so sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.13,1:04:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是该在我们的地盘还是他的地盘跟他打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it's a better plan to fight him on our turf or his...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.97,1:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但你看到了他们做的事 看到了他们能做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you saw what they did, what they can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.01,1:04:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,至少去他的地盘 还能出其不意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least on his turf, he's not expecting it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.33,1:04:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我说 我们打上门去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I say we take the fight to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.23,1:04:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.95,1:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你同意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you concur?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.08,1:04:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 斯塔克 我们去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Stark. We go to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.63,1:04:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you have to understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.90,1:04:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要我选择救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it comes to saving you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.56,1:04:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,或那孩子 或是时间宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the kid or the Time Stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.34,1:04:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会毫不犹豫地任你们死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not hesitate to let either of you die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.99,1:04:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须如此 因为这事关宇宙的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't, because the universe depends on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.12,1:04:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好三观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice. Good, moral compass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.29,1:04:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没问题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.76,1:04:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.88,1:04:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是复仇者了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an Avenger now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.41,1:05:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你可能饿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you might be hungry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.01,1:05:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直讨厌那椅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always hated that chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.89,1:05:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I've been told.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.36,1:05:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,即便如此 我还是希望有天你能坐上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even so, I'd hoped you'd sit in it one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.97,1:05:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌这个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hated this room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.26,1:06:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这艘飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.84,1:06:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌我曾经的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hated my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.20,1:06:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这你也跟我说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me that too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.40,1:06:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.60,1:06:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,说了将近20年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For almost 20 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.15,1:06:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你带走我时 我还是孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a child when you took me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.47,1:06:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.27,1:06:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.87,1:06:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们在母星上时 本来很幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We were happy on my home planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.33,1:06:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,饿着肚子睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going to bed hungry...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.22,1:06:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,到处找残羹冷炙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}scrounging for scraps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.19,1:06:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你的星球当时已濒临崩溃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your planet was on the brink of collapse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.94,1:06:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是我阻止了那发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one who stopped that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.63,1:06:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道它后来怎么样了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what's happened since then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.61,1:06:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,新生的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The children born...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.77,1:06:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,都能吃饱肚子 看到清澈的天空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have known nothing but full bellies and clear skies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.60,1:06:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那里成了天堂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a paradise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.29,1:06:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你杀了半个星球的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you murdered half the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.34,1:07:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,为了救赎 这只是小小代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A small price to pay for salvation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.35,1:07:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.52,1:07:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,小家伙 这只是简单的数学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little one, it's a simple calculus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.72,1:07:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙是有限的 资源也是有限的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This universe is finite, its resources finite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.02,1:07:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如果生命不加以控制 就会消亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If life is left unchecked, life will cease to exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.41,1:07:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,它需要纠正\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It needs correction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.59,1:07:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这你怎么知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.65,1:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只有我知道这个道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the only one who knows that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.45,1:07:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,至少 只有我愿意为此采取行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least, I'm the only one with the will to act on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.37,1:07:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.89,1:07:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你也有那样的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you had that same will...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.75,1:07:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,与我一同战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you fought by my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.98,1:07:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.88,1:07:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是你的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.02,1:07:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨自己的一切都是你教的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything I hate about myself you taught me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.64,1:07:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而你因此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, in doing so,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.95,1:07:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,也成了银河系里最威猛的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made you the fiercest woman in the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.28,1:07:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我派你去寻找灵魂宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I trusted you to find the Soul Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.52,1:08:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我让你失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I disappointed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.39,1:08:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我是失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.12,1:08:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是因为你没找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But not because you didn't find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.17,1:08:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But because you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.32,1:08:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,但你却撒谎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you lied.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.37,1:08:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,星云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nebula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.59,1:08:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.13,1:08:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,一段时间之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some time ago,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.14,1:08:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你妹妹溜上船来杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your sister snuck aboard this ship to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.15,1:08:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,求你别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.43,1:08:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还差点成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And very nearly succeeded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.32,1:08:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我把她带来了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I brought her here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.29,1:08:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好跟她谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.03,1:09:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.44,1:09:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我以生命起誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to you on my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.31,1:09:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我没找到灵魂宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never found the Soul Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.70,1:09:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,读取记忆文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accessing memory files.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.50,1:09:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他要做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what he's about to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.97,1:09:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他总算准备好了 他要去找宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's finally ready, and he's going for the stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.69,1:09:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所有宝石 - 他不可能得到所有宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All of them. - He can never get them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.04,1:09:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.91,1:09:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他不能 星云\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't, Nebula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.16,1:09:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我找到了灵魂宝石的地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I found the map to the Soul Stone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.62,1:09:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把它烧成了灰 我把它烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I burned it to ash. I burned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.56,1:09:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你很强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.35,1:09:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我教的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.95,1:09:53.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你很慷慨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're generous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.96,1:09:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我教的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.92,1:10:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,但我可没教过你撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I never taught you to lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.47,1:10:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你很不擅长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're so bad at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.52,1:10:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,灵魂宝石在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the Soul Stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.41,1:10:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,沃密尔星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vormir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.38,1:10:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,宝石在沃密尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stone is on Vormir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.33,1:10:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,带我去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.56,1:10:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Groot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.05,1:10:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,在杯子里尿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tinkle in the cup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.07,1:10:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不看 有什么可看的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not looking. What's there to see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.83,1:11:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小树枝是什么 谁都见过小树枝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a twig? Everybody's seen a twig before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.96,1:11:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Groot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.88,1:11:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,树人 把杯子里的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tree, pour what's in the cup{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.19,1:11:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,倒进太空里 然后再用杯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out into space and go in the cup again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.22,1:11:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你会格鲁特语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You speak Groot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.39,1:11:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,阿斯加德教这个 选修课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they taught it on Asgard. It was an elective.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.57,1:11:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Groot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.73,1:11:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,等我们快到了你会知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll know when we're close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.98,1:11:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,尼德威阿尔的锻炉汲取\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nidavellir's forge harnesses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.30,1:11:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,一颗中子星的炙热能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the blazing power of a neutron star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.77,1:11:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我的锤子就是在那里铸造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the birthplace of my hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.44,1:11:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可赞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's truly awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.27,1:11:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 该拿出船长的样子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, time to be the captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.40,1:11:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,弟弟死了啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, dead brother, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.43,1:11:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,对 那是挺烦人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that could be annoying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.82,1:11:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他以前也死过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he's been dead before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.17,1:11:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但这次可能是真的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, no, this time I think it really might be true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.27,1:11:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你说你还有姐姐和爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you said your sister and your dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.63,1:11:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Both dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.66,1:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,还有妈妈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But still got a mom, though?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.87,1:11:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,被黑暗精灵杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed by a dark elf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.30,1:11:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,最好朋友呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A best friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.39,1:12:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,利刃穿心而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stabbed through the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.10,1:12:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你真想执行这趟杀人任务吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure you're up to this particular murder mission?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.57,1:12:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,非常想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.10,1:12:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,愤怒 复仇 怒火 失去 后悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rage and vengeance, anger, loss, regret...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.89,1:12:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,都是很好的动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're all tremendous motivators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.20,1:12:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,让人脑袋很清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They really clear the mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.70,1:12:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm good to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.85,1:12:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 但这个灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but this Thanos we're talking about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.66,1:12:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是最厉害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's the toughest there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.90,1:12:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他是没打过我 - 他打过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, he's never fought me. - Yeah, he has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.09,1:12:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他没打过我两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's never fought me twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.40,1:12:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了 我还要去铸把新锤子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm getting a new hammer, don't forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.57,1:12:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这锤子最好厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It better be some hammer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.70,1:12:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我1500岁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm 1,500 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.83,1:12:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀过的敌人是我岁数的一倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've killed twice as many enemies as that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.04,1:12:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他们每个人都想杀死我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every one of them would've rather killed me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.02,1:12:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但没人成功过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but none succeeded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.69,1:12:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我还活着是因为命运希望我活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm only alive because fate wants me alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.60,1:12:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸只是又一个这样的混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos is just the latest in a long line of bastards...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.83,1:12:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,而他会是又一个我复仇的对象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he'll be the latest to feel my vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.71,1:12:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是命运的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fate wills it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.05,1:12:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你错了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what if you're wrong?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.26,1:13:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm wrong, then...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.29,1:13:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我还有什么可失去的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what more could I lose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.40,1:13:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以失去很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could lose a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.84,1:13:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我个人而言可以失去很多呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, personally, I could lose a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.11,1:13:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.07,1:13:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,如果命运真希望你杀了那混球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If fate does want you to kill that crapsack...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.24,1:13:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你会需要不止一颗眼球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna need more than one stupid eyeball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.26,1:13:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 你说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's this? - What's it look like?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.46,1:13:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,康特西亚星球上一个混蛋打赌输给我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some jerk lost a bet with me on Contraxia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.35,1:13:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他把眼睛给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave you his eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.45,1:13:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他给了我100信用点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he gave me 100 credits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.85,1:13:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我那晚稍后溜进了他房里偷走了他的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I snuck into his room later that night and stole his eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.77,1:13:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 好兔子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sweet rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.32,1:13:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你该洗洗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would've washed that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.93,1:14:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一能把它从康特西亚偷出来的办法就是塞进我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way I could sneak it off Contraxia was up my...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.40,1:14:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, we're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.00,1:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意好像不好使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think this thing works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.20,1:14:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么暗乎乎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything seems dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.70,1:14:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不是眼睛的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It aingt the eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.88,1:14:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,情况不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.08,1:14:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,中子星熄灭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The star's gone out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.78,1:14:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,环也冻住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the rings are frozen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.22,1:14:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,希望这些矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope these dwarves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.19,1:15:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,铸造的本事比打扫强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are better at forging than they are cleaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.68,1:15:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他们是意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they realized that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.60,1:15:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,自己住在太空里的一个垃圾堆里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they live in a junk pile in the middle of space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.03,1:15:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这个锻炉几世纪都没熄过火了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This forge hasn't gone dark in centuries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.26,1:15:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你说灭霸有个手套 是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said Thanos had a gauntlet, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.09,1:15:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对 怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.51,1:15:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,像那样的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It look anything like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.76,1:15:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Groot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.75,1:15:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,回飞行舱去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go back to the pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.50,1:15:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,伊特里 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eitri, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.44,1:15:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.37,1:15:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.23,1:15:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.31,1:15:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.04,1:15:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你本该保护我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were supposed to protect us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.32,1:15:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,阿斯加德本该保护我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard was supposed to protect us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.13,1:15:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,阿斯加德被毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asgard is destroyed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.60,1:15:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,伊特里 手套 你做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eitri, the glove. What did you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.14,1:16:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,环上住了300个矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}300 dwarves lived on this ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.59,1:16:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为如果我听从他的命令 他们就会安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought if I did what he asked, they'd be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.96,1:16:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我造出了他要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made what he wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.18,1:16:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一件能汲取宝石力量的装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A device capable of harnessing the power of the stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.63,1:16:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,然后他还是杀了所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then he killed everyone anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.76,1:16:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,除了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All except me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.59,1:16:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"你的命属于你" 他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Your life is yours," He said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.64,1:16:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"但你的手 属于我"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"But your hands are mine alone."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.57,1:16:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伊特里 你的手不是重点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eitri, this isn't about your hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.75,1:16:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你设计的每一件武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every weapon you've ever designed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.43,1:16:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,每把斧子 锤子 剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every axe, hammer, sword...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.01,1:16:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,都在你脑袋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's all inside your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.11,1:16:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你现在觉得希望尽失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I know it feels like all hope is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.05,1:17:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.11,1:17:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但你我联手 我们能杀了灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But together, you and I, we can kill Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.29,1:17:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,螳螂 听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mantis, listen very carefully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.94,1:17:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你去泰坦星见我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to meet me on Titan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.92,1:17:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.73,1:18:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们好像到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.43,1:18:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这玩意恐怕没有自动停车功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think this rig has a self-park function.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.34,1:18:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,把手伸到方向装置里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your hand inside the steering gimbal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.24,1:18:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,把这个合上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close those around it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.60,1:18:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.39,1:18:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 这是给一个大块头准备的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yep, got it. - This was meant for one big guy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.00,1:18:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们动作得同步 - 好的 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- so we gotta move at the same time. - Okay, okay. Ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.69,1:18:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我们最好转向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We might wanna turn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.02,1:18:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,转向 转向啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn! Turn! Turn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.85,1:18:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.13,1:18:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,好悬啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.79,1:18:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe you one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.49,1:18:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说 如果外星人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me just say, if aliens{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.50,1:19:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在我胸腔里植入了卵什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wind up implanting eggs in my chest or something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.69,1:19:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,而我吃掉了你们谁 那我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I eat one of you, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.88,1:19:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,余下的时间里不许你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not want another single pop culture reference{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.30,1:19:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,再提流行文化梗了 懂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}out of you for the rest of the trip. You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.86,1:19:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我是想说 有东西过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to say that something is coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.68,1:19:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.16,1:19:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托别把你的卵放进我身体里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't put your eggs in me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.70,1:19:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别动 小丑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down, clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.87,1:19:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,死吧 死亡毯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Die, blanket of death!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.91,1:20:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都别动 都给我冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody stay where you are. Chill the eff out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.08,1:20:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我就问你一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna ask you this one time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.78,1:20:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Gamora?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.03,1:20:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你个更好的 卡魔拉是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I'll do you one better. Who's Gamora?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.04,1:20:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你个更好的 为什么是卡魔拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do you one better. Why is Gamora?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.93,1:20:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我她在哪 否则我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me where the girl is or I swear to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.80,1:20:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把这小怪物烧焦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna French fry this little freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.24,1:20:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 你打我的人 我打你的人 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it. You shoot my guy and I'll blast him. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.89,1:20:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,动手吧 奎尔 我承受得住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it, Quill! I can take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.41,1:20:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他承受不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he can't take it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.48,1:20:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,她说得对 你承受不住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right. You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.42,1:20:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 你不告诉我她在哪吗 好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? You don't wanna tell me where she is? That's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.78,1:20:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我杀了你们三个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill all three of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.03,1:20:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然后揍到灭霸开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll beat it out of Thanos myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.14,1:20:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,从你开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Starting with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.03,1:20:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what, Thanos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.16,1:20:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我问你个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let me ask you this one time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.91,1:20:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你效忠哪位主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What master do you serve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.77,1:20:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我效忠哪位主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What master do I serve?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.98,1:20:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 我该说"耶稣"吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I supposed to say, "Jesus"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.85,1:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你是地球人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're from Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.57,1:20:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是地球人 我是密苏里人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not from Earth, I'm from Missouri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.66,1:20:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是地球 白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's on Earth, dipshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.07,1:20:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你打我们干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you hassling us for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.16,1:20:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你们不是灭霸的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're not with Thanos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.66,1:20:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Thanos?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.09,1:20:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是来杀灭霸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm here to kill Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.73,1:20:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他带走了我女人 等等 你们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took my girl. Wait, who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.50,1:20:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是复仇者 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the Avengers, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.08,1:20:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你们是托尔说的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the ones Thor told us about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.73,1:20:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你们认识托尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Thor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.04,1:20:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.07,1:21:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,高个 长得不咋样 还需要别人救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tall guy, not that good-looking, needed saving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.95,1:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,他现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.55,1:21:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你的计划 用砖头拍他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the plan? We're gonna hit him with a brick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.48,1:21:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这是模具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a mold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.81,1:21:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,国王的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A king's weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.55,1:21:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,本该是阿斯加德最强大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meant to be the greatest in Asgard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.53,1:21:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,理论上 它甚至能召唤彩虹桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In theory, it could even summon the Bifrost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.58,1:21:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,它有名字吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it have a name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.31,1:21:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,风暴斧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stormbreaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.98,1:21:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,有点过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a bit much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.07,1:21:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么打造它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how do we make it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.01,1:21:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你得重启锻炉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll have to restart the forge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.20,1:21:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,唤醒濒死星球的核心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awaken the heart of a dying star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.00,1:21:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,兔子 启动飞行舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rabbit, fire up the pod.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.29,1:21:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这星球遭遇了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hell happened to this planet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.40,1:22:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,偏离自转轴八度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's eight degrees off its axis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.16,1:22:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,引力到处都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gravitational pull is all over the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.79,1:22:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有一个优势 他会自己来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we got one advantage. He's coming to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.62,1:22:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要利用这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.03,1:22:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我有个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I have a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.55,1:22:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,至少有个大致轮廓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or at least the beginnings of one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.82,1:22:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,非常简单 我们引他过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty simple. We draw him in,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.10,1:22:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把他打趴下 拿到需要的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pin him down, get what we need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.65,1:22:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想陪他跳舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely don't wanna dance with this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.10,1:22:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只想拿手套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just want the gauntlet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.00,1:22:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你打哈欠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you yawning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.47,1:22:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我讲解计划的时候你竟然打哈欠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the middle of this, while I'm breaking it down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.79,1:22:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你听见我说的了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you hear what I said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.50,1:22:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你说"我们需要计划"之后我就没在听了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stopped listening after you said, "We need a plan."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.88,1:22:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他沉浸在自己的世界里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Mr. Clean is on his own page.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.41,1:22:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们习惯了随机应变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, "Not winging it" isn't really what they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.28,1:22:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那他们习惯怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, what exactly is it that they do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.93,1:22:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,打仇恨 拉群架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kick names, take ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.66,1:22:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.69,1:22:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 请各位都过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, just get over here, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.44,1:22:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,爵先生 能不能让你的伙伴们围过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Lord, can you get your folks to circle up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.46,1:22:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,别爵先生 叫我星爵就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Mr. Lord." Star-Lord is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.39,1:22:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得联合起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta coalesce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.62,1:22:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为如果我们只凭一腔勇气去面对他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause if all we come at him with is a plucky attitude...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.64,1:22:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,哥们 别说什么一腔勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, don't call us plucky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.15,1:22:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不知道那是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know what it means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.69,1:23:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我们很乐观 我喜欢你的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're optimistic, yes. I like your plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.32,1:23:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只不过它烂透了 让我来做计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except it sucks, so let me do the plan...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.00,1:23:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就完美无缺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that way it might be really good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.99,1:23:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他你斗舞拯救宇宙的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him about the dance-off to save the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.14,1:23:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么斗舞 - 不值一提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What dance-off? - It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.35,1:23:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就像那部电影《浑身是劲》一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like in Footloose, the movie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.61,1:23:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,就是《浑身是劲》那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly like Footloose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.65,1:23:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,它依然是史上最棒的电影吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it still the greatest movie in history?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.37,1:23:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,从来都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It never was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.60,1:23:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别打岔 好不好 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't encourage this, all right? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.00,1:23:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这位飞侠哥顿帮不上我们什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting no help from Flash Gordon here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.69,1:23:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,飞侠哥顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flash Gordon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.68,1:23:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是在夸我哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, that's a compliment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.56,1:23:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了 我有一半人类血统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget, I'm half human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.12,1:23:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说我有一半的蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that 50% of me that's stupid...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.86,1:23:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是百分百的蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's 100% you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.08,1:23:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我真佩服你数学这么好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your math is blowing my mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.59,1:23:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.68,1:23:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友经常那样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But does your friend often do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.56,1:23:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,斯特兰奇 没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strange, we all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.15,1:23:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你恢复了 你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're back. You're all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.24,1:23:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.53,1:23:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我推进了时间 浏览未来的可能性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went forward in time to view alternate futures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.13,1:23:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,去看即将到来的这一战所有可能出现的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To see all the possible outcomes of the coming conflict.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.33,1:24:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了多少种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.85,1:24:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,一千四百万六百零五种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14,000,605.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.76,1:24:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们赢了几种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many did we win?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.93,1:24:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.06,1:24:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,灵魂宝石最好在山上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stone had better be up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.93,1:24:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不然你妹妹就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your sister's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.71,1:25:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎 灭霸 阿拉尔斯之子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Thanos, son of Alars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.66,1:25:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉 灭霸之女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamora, daughter of Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.09,1:25:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.26,1:25:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我被诅咒认识所有来到此地的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my curse to know all who journey here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.41,1:25:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,灵魂宝石在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the Soul Stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.85,1:25:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.16,1:25:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,得到它的代价极大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it extracts a terrible price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.66,1:25:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am prepared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.65,1:25:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一开始都这么以为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all think that at first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.66,1:25:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们都错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are all wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.51,1:25:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么如此熟悉这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it you know this place so well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.95,1:26:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,上一世我也想找无限宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lifetime ago, I, too, sought the stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.69,1:26:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至曾把一个攥在手里过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even held one in my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.62,1:26:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但它把我流放到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it cast me out, banished me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.04,1:26:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,指引别人寻找我无法拥有的珍宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guiding others to a treasure I cannot possess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.55,1:26:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你所寻找的就在你面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you seek lies in front of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.43,1:26:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你所害怕的也在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As does what you fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.50,1:26:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.28,1:26:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.18,1:26:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,无限宝石中 灵魂宝石很特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soul holds a special place among the Infinity Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.73,1:26:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可以说它有一定的智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might say it has a certain wisdom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.20,1:26:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我它需要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me what it needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.21,1:26:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,为了确保拥有它的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To ensure that whoever possesses it...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.77,1:26:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,理解它的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}understands its power...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.39,1:26:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,灵魂宝石需要献祭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the stone demands a sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.38,1:26:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,献祭什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.21,1:27:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,要得到灵魂宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to take the stone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.22,1:27:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须失去自己的珍爱之物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must lose that which you love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.65,1:27:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,以一个灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A soul...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.67,1:27:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,换取一个灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.67,1:27:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我这一生 都梦想有一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my life, I dreamed of a day...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.02,1:27:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,有一瞬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.74,1:27:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,能让你得到应有的报应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you got what you deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.88,1:27:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而我总是会失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I was always so disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.72,1:27:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.31,1:27:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀戮 折磨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kill and torture...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.21,1:27:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,还说这是仁慈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you call it mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.35,1:27:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,宇宙已对你作出了评判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The universe has judged you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.96,1:28:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你想得到奖赏 而它拒绝了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked it for a prize, and it told you no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.08,1:28:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.93,1:28:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And do you wanna know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.79,1:28:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你没有爱过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you love nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.36,1:28:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你谁也不爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.54,1:28:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.30,1:28:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.30,1:28:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还流泪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tears?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.29,1:28:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是为自己流泪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.57,1:28:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.19,1:28:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.40,1:28:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾忽视过自己的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ignored my destiny once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.54,1:29:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能再重蹈覆辙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot do that again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.44,1:29:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是为你也不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.86,1:29:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起了 小家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, little one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.09,1:29:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.28,1:31:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,高度降至2600 030方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop to 2600, heading 0-3-0.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.41,1:31:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you're right about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.16,1:31:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我们降落的速度会比你希望的快得多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or we're gonna land a lot faster than you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.91,1:31:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你说我们要让瓦坎达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you said we were going to open Wakanda{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.72,1:31:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对世界开放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the rest of the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.76,1:31:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我没想到是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is not what I imagined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.04,1:31:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那你以为是什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what did you imagine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.04,1:31:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,奥运会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Olympics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.38,1:31:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,或许开家星巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe even a Starbucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.44,1:32:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要鞠躬吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we bow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.99,1:32:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,要 他是国王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, he's a king.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.56,1:32:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像总要为什么谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems like I'm always thanking you for something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.53,1:32:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.18,1:32:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这儿没这习俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, we don't do that here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.29,1:32:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会遭到多猛烈的袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how big of an assault should we expect?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.65,1:32:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我认为你应该准备应对非常猛烈的袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I think you should expect quite a big assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.71,1:32:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How we looking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.64,1:32:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的御林护卫会参战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will have my Kingsguard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.63,1:32:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还有边境部落 女子皇家护卫队 还有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Border Tribe, the Dora Milaje, and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.85,1:32:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一个还算稳定的百岁老人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a semi-stable 100-year-old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.53,1:32:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样了 巴克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you been, Buck?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.91,1:32:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,还行吧 毕竟都快世界末日了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad, for the end of the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.23,1:32:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,多态结构的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The structure is polymorphic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.74,1:32:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,对 神经元是非序列排列的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, we had to attach each neuron non-sequentially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.16,1:32:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不直接\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.20,1:32:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,重新编码突触 让它们协调工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reprogram the synapses to work collectively?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.38,1:33:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我们没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we didn't think of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.85,1:33:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你相信你尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you did your best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.43,1:33:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你能做到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.51,1:33:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,可以 但这里有超过两万亿神经元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but there are more than two trillion neurons here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.88,1:33:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,一点小误差就可能导致大规模的回路故障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One misalignment could cause a cascade of circuit failures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.51,1:33:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,会需要点时间 哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will take time, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.48,1:33:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,多长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.25,1:33:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,越长越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as you can give me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.28,1:33:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有东西进入了大气层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's entered the atmosphere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.35,1:33:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,队长 我们有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Cap, we got a situation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.12,1:33:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪 我爱这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I love this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.17,1:33:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,别高兴太早 各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, don't start celebrating yet, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.69,1:33:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,穹顶外有更多入侵者过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got more incoming outside the dome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.19,1:34:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.11,1:34:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在就得把宝石毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to destroy the stone now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.89,1:34:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,幻视 你给我躺回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vision, get your ass back on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.72,1:34:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会拖住它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will hold them off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.39,1:34:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,旺达 这石头一旦从他头部取出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanda, as soon as that stone's out of his head...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.92,1:34:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你就把它毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you blow it to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.27,1:34:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.30,1:34:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,全城疏散 启动全面防御\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evacuate the city. Engage all defenses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.11,1:34:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,给这人弄块盾牌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And get this man a shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.92,1:34:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为你没太搞懂这里的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you get the scientifics here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.37,1:34:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这些环很巨大 你想移动它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These rings are gigantic. You wanna get them moving...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.09,1:34:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,会需要大得多的东西才能把它们带动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna need something a lot bigger to yank 'em loose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.55,1:34:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 交给我 - 交给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leave that to me. - Leave it to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.75,1:34:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你在太空里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy, you're in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.48,1:35:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你就拿了一根绳和一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you got is a rope and a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.60,1:35:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,发动引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire the engines!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.02,1:35:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,再加把力 兔子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More power, rabbit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.14,1:36:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.68,1:36:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是尼德威阿尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Nidavellir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.84,1:36:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.99,1:36:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"该死"?"该死"是什么意思?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Damn it"? What's "Damn it"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.86,1:36:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,机械装置坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mechanism is crippled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.28,1:36:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 光圈不打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - With the iris closed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.90,1:36:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我就没法加热金属\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't heat the metal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.12,1:36:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,加热需要多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long will it take to heat it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.72,1:36:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,几分钟 或许更久 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few minutes, maybe more. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.17,1:36:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我去把它撑开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna hold it open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.40,1:36:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那是自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's suicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.75,1:36:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不拿风暴斧就去找灭霸也是自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So is facing Thanos without that axe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.75,1:36:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,情况如何 布鲁斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How we looking, Bruce?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.14,1:36:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我已经找到诀窍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think I'm getting the hang of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.54,1:37:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is amazing, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.13,1:37:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就像不用变身就成了绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like being the Hulk without actually...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.88,1:37:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.60,1:37:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,有两处热信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got two heat signatures{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.78,1:37:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,要冲破林线了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}breaking through the tree line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.14,1:37:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你和我们并肩作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for standing with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.53,1:38:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你那个朋友呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your other friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.85,1:38:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他的命你要用命偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will pay for his life with yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:14.14,1:38:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸会拿到那块宝石的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos will have that stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.17,1:38:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.40,1:38:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在瓦坎达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are in Wakanda now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.21,1:38:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,灭霸除了灰烬和鲜血什么也别想得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanos will have nothing but dust and blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.75,1:38:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.92,1:38:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不吝鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have blood to spare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.27,1:38:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们要投降吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They surrender?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.58,1:38:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,并没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.64,1:39:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.88,1:39:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看来惹毛她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we pissed her off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.33,1:39:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're killing themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.17,1:40:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看到他们的牙了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see the teeth on those things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.86,1:40:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你退后 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, back up, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.78,1:40:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,别烧了你的翅膀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna get your wings singed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.43,1:40:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,队长 如果他们绕过防线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cap, if these things circle the perimeter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.21,1:40:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,从我们后面进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and get in behind us...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.03,1:40:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就没人挡在他们和幻视之间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's nothing between them and Vision.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.33,1:40:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们最好确保他们都在我们眼前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we better keep 'em in front of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.12,1:40:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.93,1:40:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,打开屏障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We open the barrier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.88,1:40:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,听我口令 打开西北部17区屏障\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my signal, open North-West Section Seventeen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.39,1:40:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,请求确认 陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Requesting confirmation, My King.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.15,1:40:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说要打开屏障吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said open the barrier?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.26,1:40:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,听我口令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.50,1:40:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这将是瓦坎达的末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will be the end of Wakanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.75,1:40:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那也是史上最壮烈的末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it will be the noblest ending in history.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.08,1:41:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦坎达万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wakanda forever!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.53,1:41:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.50,1:41:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,还需要多久 苏睿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much longer, Shuri?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.04,1:41:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我都还没开始 哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've barely begun, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.55,1:41:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你最好快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might want to pick up the pace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.47,1:42:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,众神之父 赐我力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allfathers, give me strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.52,1:42:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你清楚吗 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand, boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.56,1:42:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是要承受一颗恒星的所有能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about to take the full force of a star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.50,1:42:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.60,1:42:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,除非我死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only if I die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.15,1:42:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.53,1:42:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没命就是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what killing you means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.26,1:42:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住 撑住 托尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it! Hold it, Thor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.64,1:43:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔 说话 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor! Say something. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.79,1:43:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,托尔 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thor, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.32,1:43:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得他要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he's dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.79,1:43:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他需要风暴斧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs the axe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.12,1:43:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,斧柄呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the handle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.60,1:44:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,树人 快帮我找斧柄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tree, help me find the handle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.73,1:45:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's too many of 'em!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.39,1:45:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这下你们倒霉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are so screwed now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.25,1:45:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,给我叫灭霸出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me Thanos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.52,1:46:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你更像灭霸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're much more of a Thanos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.85,1:46:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,看来乌木喉已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it the Maw is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.10,1:46:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,今天损失惨重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This day extracts a heavy toll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.44,1:46:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 他也算完成了任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, he accomplished his mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.10,1:46:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对你恐怕不是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may regret that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.35,1:46:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他带你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He brought you face-to-face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.72,1:46:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,正面迎战魔法师了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the Master of the Mystic Arts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.59,1:46:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那你觉得他把你带来了哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And where do you think he brought you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.03,1:46:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜猜 你家吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me guess. Your home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.16,1:47:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,曾经是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.35,1:47:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而且曾经美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.31,1:47:10.44,Default,,0,0,0,,泰坦曾经如同很多行星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Titan was like most planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.89,1:47:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,要吃饭的嘴多 能吃的却远远不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too many mouths, not enough to go around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.89,1:47:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们面临灭绝 我提出了解决方案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when we faced extinction, I offered a solution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.22,1:47:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,屠杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genocide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.01,1:47:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,但是随机 公正 不分贫富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But random, dispassionate, fair to rich and poor alike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.42,1:47:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说我疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called me a madman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.39,1:47:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我的预言最终成真了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what I predicted came to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.30,1:47:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜 你是预言家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, you're a prophet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.89,1:47:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a survivor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.31,1:47:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,想谋杀数十亿生命的幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who wants to murder trillions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.76,1:47:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,集齐六颗宝石 只要我一个响指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all six stones, I could simply snap my fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.95,1:47:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就将灰飞烟灭 我认为这是慈悲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would all cease to exist. I call that mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.75,1:47:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.58,1:47:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后是久违的休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd finally rest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.95,1:47:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,在全宇宙的感激中坐看日出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and watch the sun rise on a grateful universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.28,1:48:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,最难的抉择需要最强的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hardest choices require the strongest wills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.48,1:48:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你会发现我们的意志不比你弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'll find our will equal to yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.67,1:48:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.83,1:48:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,小菜一碟 奎尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Piece of cake, Quill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.45,1:48:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 如果你的目标是激怒他 你做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, if your goal was to piss him off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.13,1:49:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他握拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him close his fist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:08.32,1:49:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.84,1:49:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法再来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.62,1:49:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法踢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic with a kick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.24,1:49:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,魔法…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic with a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:15.73,1:49:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,小虫子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insect!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.30,1:49:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.65,1:49:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你本该杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've killed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.95,1:49:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那多浪费零件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would've been a waste of parts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.29,1:50:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Gamora?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.61,1:50:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,晕了吗 别放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he under? Don't let up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.78,1:50:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,要快 他很强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be quick. He is very strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.70,1:50:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,帕克 帮忙 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker, help! Get over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.89,1:50:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她控制不住多久了 开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can't hold him much longer. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.09,1:51:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,得张开他的手指才能脱下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta open his fingers to get it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.84,1:51:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为他不好抓呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you'd be hard to catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.75,1:51:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,说清楚 这是我的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the record, this was my plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.44,1:51:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不怎么威风了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not so strong now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.84,1:51:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Gamora?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.50,1:51:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我的卡魔拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Gamora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.76,1:51:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不 胡扯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.00,1:51:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.41,1:51:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他很痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is in anguish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.51,1:51:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.56,1:51:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哀悼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He... He mourns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.38,1:51:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这个怪物能为什么哀悼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does this monster have to mourn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.04,1:51:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,卡魔拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gamora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.83,1:51:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.02,1:51:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他带她去了沃密尔星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took her to Vormir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.20,1:51:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,然后带了灵魂宝石回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came back with the Soul Stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.01,1:51:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,却没有她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.30,1:51:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,奎尔 你得冷静下来 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Quill, you gotta cool it right now. You understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:46.46,1:51:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟他打 我们快拔下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't, don't. Don't engage. We almost got this off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:51.40,1:51:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我她在撒谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me she's lying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:54.64,1:51:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋 告诉我你没那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Asshole, tell me you didn't do it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.98,1:52:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.04,1:52:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.92,1:52:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.83,1:52:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么能 - 奎尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, you didn't! - Quill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.82,1:52:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, stop! Hey, stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.09,1:52:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, stop! Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.31,1:52:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,下来了 下来了 我抓到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming, it's coming. I got it, I got it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.38,1:52:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.97,1:53:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,来吃瘪啊 太空狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get some, space dogs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.52,1:53:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 叫你们好看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Get some! Get some!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.38,1:53:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊 尝尝我的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Get some!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.68,1:53:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 枪怎么卖 - 不卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How much for the gun? - Not for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.28,1:53:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那你胳膊怎么卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. How much for the arm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.00,1:53:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那胳膊我要定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'll get that arm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.88,1:53:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,新发型\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New haircut?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.28,1:53:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你学我留胡子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noticed you've copied my beard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.10,1:53:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 这是我朋友 树人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, this is a friend of mine, Tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.65,1:53:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我是格鲁特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Groot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.71,1:54:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我是史蒂夫·罗杰斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Steve Rogers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:21.32,1:54:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,撤退 马上撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fall back! Fall back, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.88,1:54:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,集中对左侧开火 萨姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Focus that fire on the left flank, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.22,1:54:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我在开火呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.26,1:55:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她刚刚怎么不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why was she up there all this time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.75,1:55:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,她下来了 去拿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's on the field. Take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.02,1:55:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 幻视那边有情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, we got a Vision situation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.14,1:55:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,谁去帮助幻视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody get to Vision!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.24,1:55:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去 - 我就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I got him! - On my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.71,1:55:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他会孤独一人死去 你也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll die alone. As will you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.42,1:55:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,她不是一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.92,1:56:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.92,1:56:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不会像纽约那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't gonna be like New York, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.56,1:56:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这套战甲能把绿巨人扁得求饶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This suit's already kicked the crap outta the Hulk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.06,1:56:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.79,1:56:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 幻视需要支援 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys! Vision needs backup, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.40,1:56:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,绿巨人 绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk? Hulk,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.98,1:56:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你喜欢最后时刻出场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you like making your entrance at the last second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.94,1:56:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,时候已经到了 这已经是最后时刻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this is it, man. This is the last, last second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.23,1:56:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,绿巨人 绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk! Hulk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.07,1:56:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,绿巨人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.68,1:56:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.28,1:56:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的 你个大绿混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, screw you, you big, green asshole!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.18,1:56:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll do it myself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.29,1:57:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.93,1:57:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,回见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See ya!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:27.43,1:57:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,绿巨人 我们有很多得谈的 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hulk, we got a lot to figure out, pal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.04,1:57:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你很强大呢 机器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were formidable, machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.97,1:57:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要死了 与常人无异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're dying, like any man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:55.13,1:57:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get outta here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.90,1:58:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.49,1:58:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,恶心死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was really gross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.29,1:58:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是叫你走吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I told you to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.90,1:58:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不以命换命 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't trade lives, Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:04.02,1:59:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,接住你了 接住你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you. I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.55,1:59:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我不记得大家的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I can't remember anybody's names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.80,1:59:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你挺会变戏法 巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're full of tricks, wizard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.36,2:00:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但你没用过你最强大的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet you never once used your greatest weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.68,2:00:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.68,2:00:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你再拿卫星砸我 我就要失控了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You throw another moon at me, and I'm gonna lose it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.38,2:00:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.80,2:00:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.42,2:00:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.07,2:00:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是唯一背负知识诅咒的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not the only one cursed with knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:25.01,2:00:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我唯一的诅咒就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only curse is you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.02,2:00:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.62,2:01:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,费这么大事 就让我留了一滴血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that for a drop of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.93,2:01:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我尊重你 斯塔克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have my respect, Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.32,2:01:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,等我完事 还有一半人类能存活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I'm done, half of humanity will still be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.16,2:01:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,希望他们会记得你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope they remember you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.21,2:02:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:15.52,2:02:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,饶他一命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spare his life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.06,2:02:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把宝石给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will give you the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.46,2:02:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不许耍花招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.52,2:02:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.92,2:03:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,还剩一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.65,2:03:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.04,2:03:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚输了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did we just lose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.29,2:03:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:54.55,2:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这是终局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in the endgame now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:22.60,2:04:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:25.95,2:04:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.05,2:04:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.15,2:04:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 到我这里 来敌人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, on my position. We have incoming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.92,2:04:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.85,2:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:17.18,2:05:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.69,2:05:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,注意 精神点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes up. Stay sharp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.06,2:05:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,旺达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.99,2:05:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.34,2:05:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.40,2:05:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们无法阻止他 旺达 但我们能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't stop him, Wanda, but we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.92,2:05:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:56.32,2:05:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你有能力摧毁宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have the power to destroy the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.87,2:05:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别 - 你必须这么做 旺达 求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't. - You must do it. Wanda, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.00,2:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.35,2:06:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.69,2:06:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.67,2:06:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.44,2:06:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他拿到宝石 半个宇宙都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he gets the stone, half the universe dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:16.15,2:06:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not fair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.94,2:06:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不该是你来的 但就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It shouldn't be you, but it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.46,2:06:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.33,2:06:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会伤害我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could never hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:36.01,2:06:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我只会感觉到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just feel you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.92,2:08:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:12.10,2:08:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:17.74,2:08:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.16,2:08:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我理解 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.78,2:08:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,比任何人都能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.94,2:08:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你才不会懂呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.81,2:09:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,今天 我失去的远超你的想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today, I lost more than you can know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.59,2:09:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在不是哀悼的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now is no time to mourn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.37,2:09:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 时间不存在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now is no time at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.04,2:09:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.76,2:10:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:40.62,2:10:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我会要你偿命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd die for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:56.88,2:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should have...{\r}
